1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,979
Whenever we skip candles in TestingView, 
the time increment is, by default, minute by minute.

2
00:00:11,279 --> 00:00:15,859
That can be changed in TestingView Options
by setting Minimum Step Forward.

3
00:00:15,859 --> 00:00:21,000
Depending on your TradingView subscription,
you can go from seconds up to hours at a time.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,119
In this example, we set
Minimum Step Forward to 5 minutes...

5
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:32,459
Now the bottom-right timestamp moves
5 minutes with each step forward.

6
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:40,179
Switch it again - this time to 30 minutes...

7
00:00:40,179 --> 00:00:44,179
...and each step advances accordingly.

8
00:00:44,179 --> 00:00:47,679
This setting isn't just for stepping forward.

9
00:00:47,679 --> 00:01:02,439
It also controls the speed and granularity
when fast-forwarding or auto-playing candles.
